{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜樓宇維修改革措施(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-02-13-35-23jaYaw2Iy.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：樓宇維修改革措施</p><p>政府成立樓宇維修支援及服務局，預料每單收費數千元，如何釐定標準？修訂建築物條例亦針對工程業界醜聞，如何落實有關措施？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>香港建造商會會長廖聖鵬</p><p>立法會議員(工程界)卜國明</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:21:14.455568+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:39.195784+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:18:27.845880+00:00","content_hash":"d3939c2cdad1f92e30c2aca9312685fd1e2d9b81431ebba0e60666ebeba28d19","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:21:14.455568+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}